#! rnews 1252
Path: summer98.example!not-for-mail
From: skylark <skylark@summer98.example>
Newsgroups: alt.games.homebrew
Subject: Last Light 0.9 - summer build (manifest)
Date: Sat, 15 Aug 1998 21:05:00 -0700
Message-ID: <ll-0815.skylark@summer98.example>
References: <ll-0001.skylark@summer98.example>
X-Fixture: fictional sample for Resurrection V5
Lines: 26

summer build. the pier is half done, the lighthouse is half a lighthouse,
june is going away at the end of the month. -- sky

LLMANIFEST 1
build summer-0.9
era 1998
title Last Light 0.9 (summer build)
credit skylark programming music
credit junebug art story
asset town inline
asset station inline
asset bunting inline
asset gulls inline
asset bakery_1998 inline
asset notice_1998 inline
asset bridge attach <junebug.19980814.2@inkwell.example> bridge.ll 710 a5055c02
asset window attach <junebug.19980721.1@inkwell.example> window.ll 257 56786f4b
asset tune attach <ll-0702.skylark@summer98.example> tune.ll 231 b4794003
asset lamp attach <ll-0730.skylark@summer98.example> lamp.ll 92 6ba39b0f
asset iris attach <junebug.19980809.1@inkwell.example> iris.npc 169 f09a3fda
asset seawall_gap inline
asset pier_old inline
asset pier_gap inline
asset point_rocks inline
asset lighthouse_scaffold inline
end
